Package: com.nightvibes.misaka15compat
Name: Misaka 15.8.8 Compatibility
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Exact-version rootless compatibility shim for Misaka 8.2.4 Beta on iPhone8,1 iOS 15.8.8. Disables the unsupported startup KFD initialization while leaving other app behavior untouched.
Maintainer: NightVibes33
Author: NightVibes33
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.8.8), firmware (<< 15.9), ellekit
